          "summary": "<p>财新网09月08日电：沪指开盘报3935.55点，涨幅0.07%。</p><p>深成指报13782.86点，涨幅0.06%；创业板指报3394.35点，跌幅0.13%；中小板指报8498.52点，涨幅0.21%。</p><p>盘面上，有色金属领涨，综合、农林牧渔、基础化工、商贸零售、纺织服饰等板块涨幅居前，银行领跌，家用电器、美容护理、电力设备、建筑材料、石油石化等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，中美未来几周将举行人工智能对话？外交部表示，双方就AI问题保持沟通；央行连续22个月增持黄金，外汇储备升至3.43万亿美元；华为时隔六年再次发布高性能芯片；六部门发文支持丝绸、茶叶、瓷器、酿造等传统产业 2028年培育50家百亿企业；主管部门进一步规范车企账期，加大执法惩处力度；字节跳动获得296亿美元贷款；小米发布首款“中折叠”手机小米18 Fold。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-08</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018430\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101018430\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">中金公司<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601995.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">16.65</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+16.65</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">中金公司“三合一”重大资产重组获批</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002796\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002796\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">星宇股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601799.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">星宇股份解约风波问责落地</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019528\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019528\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">江波龙<p><span class=\"stock-no\">301308.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">8点1氪丨711被曝员工为完成指标自掏腰包“换购”；豆包手机9月16日正式发布；“存储龙头”江波龙今日港股上市</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003426\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003426\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">远程股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002692.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">插图网（潍坊）设计有限责任公司诉远程股份侵害作品信息网络传播权纠纷案2026年9月2日在宜兴市人民法院开庭</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101006101\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101006101\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">引力传媒<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603598.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.04</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.04</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">引力传媒股份有限公司董事、高级管理人员减持股份结果公告</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术自动计算和生成，不代表财新数据观点。</li></ul></div></div>",
